#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:23
msgid ""
"Local AI for screen reader users, with nothing to install and nothing sent "
"over the internet.\n"
"Chat with GGUF language models (Qwen, Llama, Gemma, Phi, Mistral and any "
"model from HuggingFace), dictate and transcribe audio and video with Whisper "
"in about 100 languages, read the screen, images and PDFs with a vision "
"model, and speak text with a cloned voice.\n"
"Translate, summarise, proofread or explain any selected text with a "
"keystroke, in your own language.\n"
"All engines are bundled and run on the CPU. Models are downloaded on demand "
